Hello <%= @student.name.presence || 'there' %>,

We received your extension request for <%= @assignment.name %> in <%= @course.course_name %> (<%= @course.course_code %>).
<% if @request.status == 'approved' -%>
It was approved automatically and the new due date has been applied to the assignment.
<% else -%>
Course staff will review it, and you will receive another email once a decision has been made.
<% end -%>

<% @request.email_details_rows.each do |label, value| -%>
<%= label %>: <%= value %>
<% end -%>

<% if @request.status == 'pending' -%>
You can edit or cancel this request in Flextensions while it is still pending.

<% end -%>
<% if @reply_email -%>
Questions? Reply to this email to reach your course staff.
<% else -%>
If you have any questions, please contact your course staff.
<% end -%>
